  "status": "present",
  "value": "TaskManager() starts empty; every call carries a timestamp and timestamps strictly increase. addTask(timestamp, name, priority) stores a task and returns its id \"taskId<n>\" with n = 1, 2, ... in creation order (duplicates allowed). updateTask(timestamp, taskId, name, priority) replaces both fields and returns true, or returns false for an unknown id. getTask(timestamp, taskId) returns \"<name>(<priority>)\", or \"\" for an unknown id.",
